I've created a rough outline for this effort.  I'm going to need to
create some lujvo to handle the full semantic space: I promise you
there is a relevant difference between a rooster and a hen if you're
handling livestock, and jipci won't work in the context where that
difference in important.

I'm insanely unhappy with the defined word mamjipci, because motherhood
is not a precondition for being a hen (egg layer) and there is a
mother-like process hens go through called being broody, during which
time they don't lay eggs.

I've got to clean all of that up, enter new data in jbovlaste, and
return to you both gismu and some lujvo.

I'll work on it it bits here and there, and toss over the simplest
thing that could possibly work.  I'm going to be adding the data to
my own website as well, which will require effort not directly
related to your deliverable, but which is nevertheless important to
me.

Thank you!

-Alan

